{
  "id": "04669_terasu",
  "headword": "{照|て}らす",
  "reading": "てらす",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to illuminate; to shine on; to compare",
  "conjugation": {
    "type": "godan",
    "ending": "す",
    "stem": "{照|て}ら"
  },
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to illuminate; to shine on",
      "explanation": "To direct light onto something, making it visible."
    },
    {
      "sense_number": 2,
      "gloss": "to compare; to check against",
      "explanation": "To verify or examine something by comparing it with a reference."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "04669_terasu_ex1",
      "japanese": "{太陽|たいよう}が{海|うみ}を{照|て}らす。",
      "english": "The sun shines on the sea.",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "04669_terasu_ex2",
      "japanese": "スポットライトが{舞台|ぶたい}を{照|て}らす。",
      "english": "The spotlight illuminates the stage.",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "04669_terasu_ex3",
      "japanese": "{月|つき}が{道|みち}を{明|あか}るく{照|て}らしていて、{懐中電灯|かいちゅうでんとう}がなくても{歩|ある}けた。",
      "english": "The moon was brightly illuminating the road, so I could walk even without a flashlight.",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "04669_terasu_ex4",
      "japanese": "{原文|げんぶん}と{照|て}らし{合|あ}わせる。",
      "english": "Check against the original text.",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "04669_terasu_ex5",
      "japanese": "データを{過去|かこ}の{記録|きろく}と{照|て}らし{合|あ}わせてください。",
      "english": "Please compare the data against past records.",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "04669_terasu_ex6",
      "japanese": "{法律|ほうりつ}に{照|て}らして{考|かんが}えると、この{契約|けいやく}には{問題|もんだい}がある。",
      "english": "Considering it in light of the law, there is a problem with this contract.",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "{照|て}らす is a transitive verb ({他動詞|たどうし}).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pair: {照|て}る (intransitive - to shine)\n- Pattern: Xが〜を{照|て}らす\n\nASPECT ({ている}):\n{照|て}らしている indicates ongoing illumination.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {月|つき}が{照|て}らす (the moon illuminates)\n- {太陽|たいよう}が{照|て}らす (the sun shines on)\n- {照|て}らし{合|あ}わせる (to compare, check against)\n- 〜に{照|て}らして (in light of ~, considering ~)\n\nThe compound {照|て}らし{合|あ}わせる is commonly used when verifying documents or comparing information.",
